# A Gym Leader of Hoenn (Emerald's Leader battle theme): a hard-driving brass line in E minor over pounding timpani,
# a pumping synth bass and stabs of strings, with a second strain that climbs through C and D. Original composition
# for this game (plan 21 · H2, part b).
title Battle! Gym Leader (Hoenn)
tempo 162
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.07
reverb 0.18

track lead trumpet lowhp=sawlead vol=0.78 pan=0.05 rev=0.2
  o5 e8 r8 e8 r8 e8 r8 d8 r8 | o5 e8 r8 g8 r8 b4 b4 | L o5 e4. g8 b4 g4 | o5 c4 e8 g8 o6 c4 o5 g4 |
  o5 d4. f+8 a4 f+4 | o5 b2 b4 r4 | o5 e4. g8 b4 o6 e4 | o5 c4 e8 g8 e4 c4 |
  o5 d4 f+8 a8 o6 d4 o5 a4 | o5 b2. r4 |

